-Resistant (No Rain Cover Needed)<\/li><li>Built-In Trolley Strap Allows Attachment to Rolling Luggage<\/li><\/ul><p><em>Urban UL1 Sling Bag Features:<\/em><\/p><ul><li> Thickened compartment accommodates 8.3-inch tablet.<\/li><li> Central compartment fits daily-use cameras, including point-and-shoot models.<\/li><li> Small central pocket for portable key sets, flashlights, and camera SD cards.<\/li><li>​Front quick-access zip pocket for hand sanitizer; hidden rear pocket for smartphone.<\/li><li> Detachable shoulder strap doubles as a digital storage pouch.​<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","liquid":"","text_size":"text-sm"}},"collapsible_tab_qcDFmz":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"opened":false,"style":"with-border","icon":"swatchbook","heading":"Materials","content":"<p><strong>The set includes the<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.bagsmart.com\/products\/getaway-carry-on-luggage?variant=41230567833682&_rtId_=mconl95d_gL0PdWa8\" target=\"_blank\"><strong> <\/strong><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/nayosmart.com\/zh-tw\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u5-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/nayosmart.com\/zh-tw\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u5-backpack\"><strong>Urban U5 Backpack-White<\/strong><\/a><strong> and <\/strong><a href=\"\/products\/urban-ul1-sling-bag-white\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban UL1 Sling Bag-White\"><strong>Urban UL1 Sling Bag-White<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p><em>Urban U5 Backpack <\/em>Materials<em>:<\/em><\/p><ul><li><strong>Exterior<\/strong>: The outer layer is crafted from 100% nylon and treated with a DuPont™ triple-protection coating that provides anti-static, water-resistant, and oil-repellent performance.<\/li><li><strong>Interior<\/strong>: The lining is made of a durable, textured fabric that enhances both structure and comfort.<\/li><li><strong>Hardware<\/strong>: The bag features reliable Duraflex® buckles and SBS zippers, ensuring long-lasting use and smooth everyday functionality.<\/li><\/ul><p><em>Urban UL1 Sling Bag <\/em>Materials<em>:<\/em><\/p><p><strong>External:<\/strong> Crafted from durable 200D nylon with DuPont® protection, offering water-repellent, stain- and oil-resistant performance.<\/p><p><strong>Internal:<\/strong> Lined with embossed PU-coated 210T polyester for a smooth and refined finish.<\/p><p><strong>Hardware: <\/strong>Features a Duraflex® buckle and SBS® zipper for reliable daily function.<\/p>","page":"","liquid":"","text_size":"text-sm"}},"collapsible_tab_bmTfYc":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"opened":false,"style":"with-border","icon":"ruler","heading":"Dimensions","content":"<p><strong>Weight:<\/strong> 1500g<\/p><p><a href=\"\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u5-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban U5 Backpack-White\"><strong>Urban U5 Backpack-White:<\/strong><\/a><br\/><strong>Capacity:<\/strong> 20L<br\/><strong>Dimensions:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Height:<\/strong> 18\" (45cm)<\/li><li><strong>Length:<\/strong> 14\" (35cm)<\/li><li><strong>Width:<\/strong> 6\" (16cm)<\/li><\/ul><p><a href=\"\/products\/urban-ul1-sling-bag-white\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban UL1 Sling Bag-White\"><strong>Urban UL1 Sling Bag-White<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p><strong>Capacity:<\/strong> 6L<br\/><strong>Dimensions:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Height:<\/strong> 11\" (27cm)<\/li><li><strong>Length:<\/strong> 4.5\" (11.5cm)<\/li><li><strong>Width:<\/strong> 7.5\" (19cm)<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","liquid":"","text_size":"text-sm"}},"collapsible_tab_DdcEUJ":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"opened":false,"style":"with-border","icon":"devices","heading":"Will My Device Fit?","content":"<p><a href=\"\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u5-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban U5 Backpack-White\"><strong>Urban U5 Backpack-White:<br\/><\/strong><\/a><br\/>✔️ PC 13\"<\/p><p>✔️ MacBook Air 13.3\"<\/p><p>✔️ MacBook Pro 13.3\"<\/p><p>✔️ PC 14\"<\/p><p>✔️ PC 15\"<\/p><p>✔️ PC 15.6\"<\/p><p>✔️ MacBook Pro 16\"<\/p><p>✔️ PC 16\"<\/p><p>❌ PC 17\"<\/p><p>✔️ iPad Pro 12.9\"<\/p><p>✔️ iPad Pro 1